   "originalText": "Caveat: examples/02-review-service's ReviewRepository is a concrete class, not a declared Port interface the core",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 10.5
  },
  {
   "id": "t210336279",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 564,
   "width": 739.2,
   "height": 13.125,
